<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: PUT api/Attendence/location</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Updates existing data or changes state for api/Attendence/location.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> JWT authentication required; Self-user validation is enforced for user-specific data</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> dto from body as LocationUpdateDto</p>
<p><b>Request fields:</b> UserId (int), Latitude (double), Longitude (double)</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns JSON fields: Message, UserId, Latitude, Longitude, UpdatedAt, GoogleMapsLink</p>
