<p><b>What it does:</b> Fetches data for api/Shift.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> JWT authentication required; Permission: SHIFT_VIEW</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> No request body or explicit parameter is defined on the action signature.</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns a success result based on the controller logic.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> No explicit custom error response found in controller logic beyond framework-level validation.</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: GET api/Shift/assigned-users</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Fetches data for api/Shift/assigned-users.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> JWT authentication required; Permission: SHIFT_VIEW</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> No request body or explicit parameter is defined on the action signature.</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns a success result based on the controller logic.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 404 Not Found: &quot;No shift assignments found&quot;</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: GET api/Shift/user/{userId}</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Fetches data for api/Shift/user/{userId}.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> JWT authentication required; Permission: SHIFT_VIEW; Self-user validation is enforced for user-specific data</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> userId from route/query as int</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns a success result based on the controller logic.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 404 Not Found: &quot;Shift not assigned&quot;</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 403 Forbidden</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: POST api/Shift</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Creates or submits data for api/Shift.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> JWT authentication required; Permission: SHIFT_CREATE</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> dto from route/query as ShiftCreateDto</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns success message text.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> No explicit custom error response found in controller logic beyond framework-level validation.</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: POST api/Shift/assign</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Creates or submits data for api/Shift/assign.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> JWT authentication required; Permission: SHIFT_ASSIGN</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> userId from route/query as int</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> shiftId from route/query as int</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns success message text.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> No explicit custom error response found in controller logic beyond framework-level validation.</p>
<p><b>Note:</b> Triggers an in-app notification.</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h2>To-Do Module</h2>
<p><b>Module description:</b> Manages task assignments and task status updates.</p>
<p><b>Base route:</b> api/Todo</p>
<p><b>Endpoints in this module:</b> 4</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: GET api/Todo</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Fetches data for api/Todo.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> Additional role-based checks are applied in controller logic</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> No request body or explicit parameter is defined on the action signature.</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns a success result based on the controller logic.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 401 Unauthorized</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: POST api/Todo</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Creates or submits data for api/Todo.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> Review application auth filters for access control.</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> dto from body as TodoCreateDto</p>
<p><b>Request fields:</b> Title (string), Description (string), AssignedTo (int), DueDate (DateTime), Status (string)</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns success message text.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 400 Bad Request: &quot;Invalid request&quot;</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 401 Unauthorized</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 403 Forbidden</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: PUT api/Todo/{id}</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Updates existing data or changes state for api/Todo/{id}.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> Review application auth filters for access control.</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> id from route/query as int</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> dto from body as TodoCreateDto</p>
<p><b>Request fields:</b> Title (string), Description (string), AssignedTo (int), DueDate (DateTime), Status (string)</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns success message text.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 404 Not Found: &quot;Task not found&quot;</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 401 Unauthorized</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 403 Forbidden</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
<h3>Endpoint: DELETE api/Todo/{id}</h3>
<p><b>What it does:</b> Deletes or clears data for api/Todo/{id}.</p>
<p><b>Access:</b> Review application auth filters for access control.</p>
<p><b>Request:</b> id from route/query as int</p>
<p><b>Success response:</b> Returns success message text.</p>
<p><b>Error response:</b> 404 Not Found: &quot;Task not found&quot;</p>
<p class="sp"></p>
